@startuml UC14_Logout_Sequence_Diagram

title UC14: Logout - Sequence Diagram

actor "End User" as User
participant "Frontend" as Frontend

User -> Frontend: Select "Log out"
Frontend -> Frontend: Call Firebase Client SDK\nsign-out method
Frontend -> Frontend: Clear cached ID token and\nrefresh token from local\npersistence (this device only)

note over Frontend
  Option A - local-only logout: no call
  to the Authentication Service or the
  User Actions Server, no server-side
  token revocation. Other devices/
  sessions remain logged in; a token
  stolen before logout still works
  elsewhere until it naturally expires.
end note

Frontend -> User: Redirect to login form (UC1)

@enduml
